{"id":"C37c836aa12061b96d052","zh":"模态综合","en":"component mode synthesis method","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","definition_zh":"利用子结构模态信息建立整体降阶动力模型的方法。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C37c836aa12061b96d052","zh":"模态综合","en":"component mode synthesis method","domain":"环境振动与轨道减振","group_id":"Head86e9c01235d6569e0","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"环境振动与轨道减振 · 张小安等（2025）"}],"designations":[{"id":"De9269701dc8538043f8e","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"模态综合"},{"id":"D601e739b7b4f46bbff85","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"component mode synthesis method"}],"sources":{"P133":{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sf6cab5ba0921ccf7c5b1","source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"按照子结构界面处理方式的不同, 动态子结构法主要包括固定界面模态综合法、自由界面模态综合法和混合界面模态综合法 [12],其中固定界面模态综合(component mode synthesis method, CMS)法概念清晰且不会出现刚体位移和零频率 [13],该方法通过将复杂整体模型划分成若干简单子结构模型,通过提取子结构中的主模态对刚度和质量矩阵进行降阶变换,并根据子结构界面间的位移关系,组装总体模型重新对降阶后的运动方程进行求解,进而得到整体模型的动态响应 [14],因此在研究复杂系统结构自身动力分析方面具有显著优势。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S84cf3cebc1c25ee26e73","source_id":"P133","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"本文基于动态子结构法中的固定界面模态综合法建立隧道−土体−上盖建筑二维有限元模型,通过与整体结构有限元模型计算结果对比,验证该方法在车致环境振动研究中的有效性,并探究人工边界的施加问题。","citations":[{"source_id":"P133","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"Cd2bc145149cdc14d4056","target_concept_id":"Cd2bc145149cdc14d4056","target_zh":"固定界面模态综合法","target_en":"fixed-interface component mode synthesis","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C37dc05dab8977962ba68","target_concept_id":"C37dc05dab8977962ba68","target_zh":"环境振动","target_en":"environmental vibration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C1b3092e686709cdfb17b","target_concept_id":"C1b3092e686709cdfb17b","target_zh":"有限元模型","target_en":"finite element model","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C558a54f76c1d5ff7359b","target_concept_id":"C558a54f76c1d5ff7359b","target_zh":"上盖建筑","target_en":"over-track building","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C93c37caef64a733d7839","target_concept_id":"C93c37caef64a733d7839","target_zh":"质量矩阵","target_en":"mass matrix","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P133","title":"地铁上盖建筑车致环境振动预测模型及影响因素研究","authors":"张小安,王庞瑞,李姝婷,杨建近,徐磊,张晓芸","year":"2025","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20250090","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"张小安等（2025）","overview_slug":"2025-study-on-the-prediction-of-building-vibration-induced-by-subway-operation-and-influencing-factors"}]}